#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Exporting Text Files"
msgstr "Exportera textfiler"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:6
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can export worksheets to structured text"
" files. To create a text file one chooses the <guimenuitem>Export As Text "
"File...</guimenuitem> item in the <guimenu>Export Data</guimenu> submenu of "
"the <guimenu>Data</guimenu> menu. In the dialog, one specifies the file "
"name, and selects the folder in which to save it, retaining the file format "
"\"Text export (configurable)\". Upon clicking <interface>Save</interface> "
"the <interface>Text Export</interface> druid appears which permits the "
"configuration of file structure characteristics."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan exportera kalkylblad till "
"strukturerade textfiler. Skapa en textfil genom att välja "
"<guimenuitem>Exportera som textfil...</guimenuitem> i undermenyn "
"<guimenu>Exportera data</guimenu> på menyn <guimenu>Data</guimenu>. Ange "
"filnamn och mapp i dialogrutan och behåll filformatet ”Textexport "
"(konfigurerbar)”. När du klickar på <interface>Spara</interface> öppnas "
"guiden <interface>Textexport</interface>, där du kan konfigurera filens "
"struktur."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:18
msgid "The Text Export Druid."
msgstr "Guiden Textexport."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:20
msgid "The steps involved in the text export druid are:"
msgstr "Så här använder du guiden för textexport:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:24
msgid ""
"Launch the <interface>Text export</interface> druid using, in the "
"<guimenuitem>Export As Text File...</guimenuitem> item in the "
"<guimenu>Export Data</guimenu> submenu of the <guimenu>Data</guimenu> "
"retaining the \"Text export (configurable)\" file format type."
msgstr ""
"Starta guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> genom att välja "
"<guimenuitem>Exportera som textfil...</guimenuitem> i undermenyn "
"<guimenu>Exportera data</guimenu> på menyn <guimenu>Data</guimenu>. Behåll "
"filformatet ”Textexport (konfigurerbar)”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:33
msgid "Select the worksheets to include in the exported file."
msgstr "Välj vilka kalkylblad som ska ingå i den exporterade filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:38
msgid "Configure the order of the worksheets for the exported file."
msgstr "Ändra ordningen på kalkylbladen i den exporterade filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:43
msgid "Go to the second panel."
msgstr "Gå till den andra panelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:48
msgid "Select the line termination character."
msgstr "Välj tecknet som markerar radslut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:53
msgid "Select the value separating character or character sequence"
msgstr "Välj tecknet eller teckensekvensen som skiljer värden åt"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:58
msgid ""
"Select when values should be surrounded by a text indicating character."
msgstr "Välj när värden ska omges av ett tecken som anger text."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:63
msgid "Select the character or sequence to use to indicate a text field."
msgstr "Välj tecknet eller teckensekvensen som ska markera ett textfält."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:68
msgid "Configure the character encoding to use for the file."
msgstr "Ange vilken teckenkodning filen ska använda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:73
msgid "Select how to handle unknown characters."
msgstr "Välj hur okända tecken ska hanteras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:78
msgid "Select whether to preserve the format of the cell contents."
msgstr "Ange om cellernas talformat ska bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:83
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button to export the file."
msgstr "Klicka på <guibutton>Slutför</guibutton> för att exportera filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:94
msgid "The Components of the <interface>Text Export</interface> Druid"
msgstr "Delarna i guiden <interface>Textexport</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:98
msgid ""
"The <interface>Text Export</interface> druid consists of two panels. The "
"first panel allows the user to select the worksheets included in the export "
"and their order. The second panel allows the user to configure the "
"structuring elements, the line delimiting characters, value separating "
"characters, text indicating characters, and file encoding."
msgstr ""
"Guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> består av två paneler. I den första"
" väljer du vilka kalkylblad som ska exporteras och i vilken ordning. I den "
"andra konfigurerar du filens struktur, radslut, tecken som skiljer värden "
"åt, tecken som markerar text samt teckenkodning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:108
msgid "The first panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> Druid."
msgstr "Guidens första panel för <interface>Textexport</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:112
msgid ""
"The first panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> Druid allows users"
" to set the file encoding, to determine the character sequences used to "
"separate lines, configure the type of structuring being used and select the "
"lines of the file to import."
msgstr ""
"I den första panelen i guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> anger du "
"filens teckenkodning, väljer vilka tecken som skiljer rader åt och vilken "
"struktur som ska användas samt väljer vilka rader i filen som ska "
"importeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:121
msgid ""
"The first panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> druid with the "
"component areas labeled with callouts."
msgstr ""
"Första panelen i guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> med de olika "
"områdena utpekade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:132
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the first panel 'Text Export' druid with callouts "
"labeling the different areas."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar den första panelen i guiden ”Textexport” med de olika "
"områdena utpekade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:138
msgid ""
"The different components of the first panel of the <interface>Text "
"Export</interface> druid with each component labeled with a callout."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i den första panelen i guiden "
"<interface>Textexport</interface>, var och en utpekad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:157
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> - The worksheet selection area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> – Område för kalkylbladsval."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:162
msgid ""
"This area allows the user to select the worksheets to be included in the "
"file. By default, only the top most sheet will have its checkbox checked and"
" be included in the export. The user can add sheets by clicking in their "
"checkboxes to set the check marks."
msgstr ""
"Här väljer du vilka kalkylblad som ska ingå i filen. Som standard är endast "
"kryssrutan för det översta bladet markerad, så att bara det bladet "
"exporteras. Markera kryssrutorna för att lägga till fler blad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:173
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> - The worksheet selection and ordering "
"buttons."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> – Knappar för att välja och ordna "
"kalkylblad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:178
msgid ""
"The top two buttons allows the user quickly to select or unselect all the "
"worksheets to be included in the export file. The bottom two buttons allow "
"the user to change the order of the worksheets in the file to be exported."
msgstr ""
"De två översta knapparna väljer eller avmarkerar snabbt alla kalkylblad som "
"ska ingå i exportfilen. Med de två nedersta knapparna ändrar du ordningen på"
" bladen i filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:189
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">3</emphasis> – Knapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:193
msgid ""
"These three buttons allow the user to navigate the druid. The "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. The <guibutton>Back</guibutton> button is disable "
"since this is the first panel of the druid. The "
"<guibutton>Forward</guibutton> button will dismiss the first panel and bring"
" up the second panel of the druid."
msgstr ""
"De här tre knapparna används för att gå igenom guiden. "
"<guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> stänger dialogrutan och återgår till "
"kalkylbladet. <guibutton>Bakåt</guibutton> är inaktiverad eftersom det här "
"är guidens första panel. Med <guibutton>Framåt</guibutton> stänger du den "
"första panelen och går vidare till den andra."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:148
msgid ""
"The purpose of each labeled component in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"textExport-druid-panel1\"/> is explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Nedan beskrivs syftet med varje utpekad del i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"textExport-druid-panel1\"/>: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:218
msgid "The second panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> Druid."
msgstr "Guidens andra panel för <interface>Textexport</interface>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:222
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> Druid allows "
"users to select the line termination character, configure the value "
"separating character, select the text indicating character and set the "
"character encoding."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelen i guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> väljer du "
"tecknet som markerar radslut, anger tecknet som skiljer värden åt, väljer "
"tecknet som markerar text och anger teckenkodningen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:230
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Text Export</interface> druid with the "
"component areas labeled with callouts."
msgstr ""
"Andra panelen i guiden <interface>Textexport</interface> med de olika "
"områdena utpekade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:240
msgid ""
"This screenshot depicts the second panel 'Text Export' druid with callouts "
"labeling the different areas."
msgstr ""
"Skärmbilden visar den andra panelen i guiden ”Textexport” med de olika "
"områdena utpekade."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:246
msgid ""
"The different components of the second panel of the <interface>Text "
"Export</interface> druid with each component labeled with a callout."
msgstr ""
"De olika delarna i den andra panelen i guiden "
"<interface>Textexport</interface>, var och en utpekad."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:264
msgid "The components of the second panel"
msgstr "Delarna i den andra panelen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:267
msgid ""
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> - The export characteristic menu "
"buttons."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">1</emphasis> – Knappar för exportinställningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:278
msgid "Line Delimiting Character-"
msgstr "Tecken för radslut –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:281
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to activate a drop down list from which to "
"select the character used to indicate the end of a line and beginning of the"
" next. The three commonly used alternatives are provided. See <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-lineBreak\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen öppnar du en lista där du väljer tecknet som markerar "
"slutet på en rad och början på nästa. De tre vanligaste alternativen finns i"
" listan. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-"
"complex-lineBreak\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:292
msgid "Value Separating Character-"
msgstr "Tecken som skiljer värden åt –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:295
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to select a character to use as a value "
"separator. The \"Custom\" type will active the text entry area to allow the "
"user to determine a particular character or character sequence to use to "
"delimit data values. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-"
"dataStruct\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen väljer du tecknet som ska skilja värden åt. Om du väljer"
" ”Anpassad” aktiveras ett textfält där du kan ange ett visst tecken eller en"
" teckensekvens som avgränsare. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"file-textImport-complex-dataStruct\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:307
msgid "Value Separating Character entry area-"
msgstr "Fält för tecken som skiljer värden åt –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:310
msgid ""
"This entry area allows the user to define explicitly the character or "
"character sequence which should be used to separate each value field on "
"every line. This area is only active if the \"Custom\" type has been "
"selected from the list in the button above."
msgstr ""
"Här anger du uttryckligen tecknet eller teckensekvensen som ska skilja "
"värdefälten åt på varje rad. Fältet är bara aktivt om du har valt ”Anpassad”"
" i listan på knappen ovan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:320
msgid "The Text Field Delimiter activity setting-"
msgstr "Inställning för textfältets citattecken –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:324
msgid ""
"This button activates a list with three choices for the use of text field "
"delimiters. Text fields can be delimited only where needed, meaning that the"
" quote characters will only be used if the value contains the character used"
" as a separator or a space. Alternatively the text field separators can be "
"used around all values or never applied. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-"
"textImport-complex-dataStruct\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen väljer du ett av tre alternativ för citattecken runt "
"textfält. Du kan använda citattecken bara när det behövs, det vill säga när "
"ett värde innehåller avgränsningstecknet eller ett blanksteg. Du kan också "
"använda citattecken runt alla värden eller inte alls. Mer information finns "
"i <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-complex-dataStruct\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:338
msgid "The Text Field Delimiter character entry area and list-"
msgstr "Fält och lista för textfältets citattecken –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:341
msgid ""
"This area can be used as a text entry area to type the character to use to "
"delimit text fields. Alternatively, three pre-selected characters, double "
"quotes or single quotes, can be selected from the drop down list which "
"appears by clicking on the downward pointing arrow to the right of the text "
"field."
msgstr ""
"I textfältet kan du ange tecknet som ska omge textfält. Du kan också välja "
"ett av tre förinställda tecken i listrutan som öppnas med nedåtpilen till "
"höger om fältet: dubbla eller enkla citattecken."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:352
msgid "File encoding selection button-"
msgstr "Knapp för val av teckenkodning –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:355
msgid ""
"This button allows the user to set the encoding scheme to use for the file. "
"By default, <application>Gnumeric</application> selects the encoding scheme "
"used by the locale of the user. See <xref linkend=\"sect-file-textImport-"
"complex-encoding\"/> for more details."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen anger du vilken teckenkodning filen ska använda. Som "
"standard väljer <application>Gnumeric</application> den kodning som gäller "
"för användarens systemlokal. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"file-textImport-complex-encoding\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:366
msgid "The unknown character handling setting button-"
msgstr "Knapp för hantering av okända tecken –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:369
msgid ""
"This button selects whether to escape or transliterate characters which "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> does not recognize."
msgstr ""
"Med den här knappen väljer du om tecken som "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> inte känner igen ska ersättas med "
"escape-sekvenser eller translittereras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:377
msgid "The format preservation checkbox-"
msgstr "Kryssruta för att bevara format –"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:380
msgid ""
"This checkbox sets whether to preserve the number formats for formatted "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Med den här kryssrutan väljer du om talformaten för formaterade värden ska "
"bevaras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:272
msgid ""
"These drop down menus provide to set the different configuration parameters "
"for the exported file. The various menus are as follows. "
"<_:itemizedlist-1/>."
msgstr ""
"I de här listrutorna anger du olika parametrar för den exporterade filen. "
"Listorna beskrivs här: <_:itemizedlist-1/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:391
msgid "<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> - The button area."
msgstr "<emphasis role=\"bold\">2</emphasis> – Knapparna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:395
msgid ""
"These three buttons allow the user to navigate the druid. The "
"<guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> button will dismiss the dialog and return the "
"user to the worksheet. The <guibutton>Back</guibutton> button is disable "
"since this is the first panel of the druid. The "
"<guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button will dismiss the druid and cause the "
"file to be saved using the selected options."
msgstr ""
"De här tre knapparna används för att gå igenom guiden. "
"<guibutton>Avbryt</guibutton> stänger dialogrutan och återgår till "
"kalkylbladet. <guibutton>Bakåt</guibutton> är inaktiverad eftersom det här "
"är guidens första panel. Med <guibutton>Slutför</guibutton> stänger du "
"guiden och sparar filen med de valda inställningarna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:257
msgid ""
"The purpose of each labeled component in <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"textExport-druid-panel2\"/> is explained below: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"Nedan beskrivs syftet med varje utpekad del i <xref linkend=\"fig-file-"
"textExport-druid-panel2\"/>: <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:2
msgid "Sending Files"
msgstr "Skicka filer"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:4
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> can send files directly as attachments "
"to an electronic mail (email) message, as long as "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> is run in an environment where it can "
"access an Email client."
msgstr ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> kan skicka filer som bilagor i "
"e-postmeddelanden om <application>Gnumeric</application> körs i en miljö där"
" programmet har tillgång till en e-postklient."
